  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray, drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic seasoning and season with salt.\n• Toss to coat and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cc0cf620282e9850a7d/step-016c6800.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate beetroot.\n• Thinly slice brown onion (see ingredients).\n• In a large frying pan, heat a good drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook beetroot, onion, the balsamic vinegar and brown sugar until softened, 2-3 mins.\n• Add the water and cook, stirring occasionally, until reduced, 5-6 mins. Transfer to a bowl. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cc0cf620282e9850a7d/step-e90e2910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Pat haloumi dry, then slice horizontally to get 1 piece per person.\n• Wash and dry frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi with a splash of water, until golden, 2 mins each side.\n• Meanwhile, halve continental rolls and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cc0cf620282e9850a7d/step-3e0a7820.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine the BBQ sauce and smokey aioli.\n• Spread roll bases with BBQ aioli. Top with salad leaves, haloumi and beetroot relish.\n• Serve with fries.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cc0cf620282e9850a7d/step-370bb530.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
